prompt:
Use the supplied Nova Stitch gameplay sprite as the identity/style reference. Create an original 1536×1024 transparent RGBA sprite sheet containing exactly eleven separate complete full-body poses of Nova Stitch performing a basketball push/body-check, in a four-column by three-row grid, row-major. Put poses0–10 in the first eleven cells and leave the final cell (row3 column4) transparent. Keep a consistent right-facing source direction, scale and camera. Keep each pose inside its own cell. No scene, floor, court, shadow, glow, text, numbers, other athletes, basketball, prop or background.

Nova is a young athletic fair-tan woman with long curly teal hair in a high ponytail, distinct human face, teal jersey and shorts with purple/black trim, black knee pads, teal-and-black sneakers and wristbands. Preserve her exact body, face, ponytail and uniform colors in all poses. Keep hands empty; no ball or prop is drawn. This is a controlled in-game defensive body-check, not a fight: no punches, kicks, weapons, injury, or fallen/prone character. Show Nova’s upper-arm/shoulder nudging an unseen opponent, never a strike.

Eleven connected, visibly distinct poses:
0 neutral right-facing ready stance, hands low;
1 lower defensive stance and prepare to step in;
2 drive off the rear foot toward image-right, shoulder turning;
3 close the space, arm bent and shoulder leading;
4 lean in, upper arm/shoulder aligned for contact, other arm balancing;
5 CONTACT at simulation tick8: brief shoulder-to-shoulder bump pose, stable feet, no punch;
6 continue a short safe follow-through, arm raised but open hand;
7 recoil naturally as the opponent moves away, regain balance;
8 lower the arms and step back;
9 stand upright, return to defensive stance;
10 reset in a balanced right-facing ready pose.
No other figure is drawn. Keep all limbs, hands, ponytail and shoes clear, anatomically correct and fully visible.

Match the supplied tiny 2D arcade sprite with crisp limited-palette 1990s pixel art and chunky dark outlines, not painterly, photorealistic, 3D, glossy or anime. True transparent background and gutters; no matte or checkerboard. Return only the sheet.
